<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Photography on hiddenbyte.log</title><link>https://mehul.pt/tags/photography/</link><description>Recent content in Photography on hiddenbyte.log</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mehul.pt/tags/photography/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Camí de Picasso</title><link>https://mehul.pt/posts/hike-cami-picasso/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mehul.pt/posts/hike-cami-picasso/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;The only journey is the one within.&amp;rdquo; - Rainer Maria Rilke&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Last month, between the 2nd and 5th of September, I hiked a trail known as the &lt;a href="https://hiking-trails.com/trail/cami-picasso/"&gt;Camí de Picasso&lt;/a&gt; in Catalonia, Spain, over four days. Since I am currently a bit too lazy to write about the trail, I am leaving a trail of photos instead.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="day-1---guardiola-de-berguedà---saldes"&gt;Day 1 - Guardiola de Berguedà - Saldes&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Distance: 21.1 km. Elevation: +1,016 / −541 m.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Wandering through April</title><link>https://mehul.pt/posts/april-2026-photo-dump/</link><pubDate>Mon, 04 May 2026 14:13:33 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://mehul.pt/posts/april-2026-photo-dump/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The following photos were taken during April of 2026.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&#10; &lt;source&#10; type="image/webp"&#10; srcset="https://mehul.pt/posts/april-2026-photo-dump/IMG_20260404_190845572_hu_259fc178947a9d08.webp 480w, https://mehul.pt/posts/april-2026-photo-dump/IMG_20260404_190845572_hu_d3f05af9e025fc3a.webp 720w, https://mehul.pt/posts/april-2026-photo-d